<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>PMG Services | Financial Transformation &amp; Digitalization Consulting</title>
    <meta name="description" content="PMG Services turns finance data into reliable forecasts and clear reporting — FP&amp;A, financial process automation with AI agents, and custom ERP integration for businesses worldwide." />
    <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://pmg-services.net/" />
    <link rel="icon" href="./assets/favicon.png" type="image/png" />

    <!-- Mobile browser chrome color -->
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0b1d2c" />


    <!-- Google Analytics 4 — GDPR-compliant: loads only after cookie consent.
         Set your Measurement ID once in consent.js (GA_ID constant). -->
    <script src="consent.js?v=3" defer></script>

    <!-- Open Graph -->
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="PMG Services | Financial Transformation &amp; Digitalization Consulting" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="FP&amp;A, financial process automation with AI agents, and custom financial systems — we turn your data into forecasts and reporting you can act on." />
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://pmg-services.net/assets/logo.png" />
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://pmg-services.net/" />

    <!-- Twitter Card -->
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="PMG Services | Financial Transformation &amp; Digitalization Consulting" />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="FP&amp;A, financial process automation with AI agents, and custom financial systems for mid-market finance teams." />
    <meta name="twitter:image" content="https://pmg-services.net/assets/logo.png" />

    <!-- hreflang -->
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="en" href="https://pmg-services.net/" />
    <link rel="alternate" hreflang="de" href="https://pmg-services.net/?lang=de" />

    <!-- Fonts — self-hosted. No request reaches Google before consent (GDPR / LG München I, 2022). -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="./assets/fonts/fonts.css?v=1" />

    <!-- Stylesheets -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css?v=34" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="mediaqueries.css?v=9" />

    <!-- JSON-LD Structured Data -->
    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "ProfessionalService",
      "name": "PMG Services",
      "description": "Financial transformation and digitalization consulting — FP&A, financial process automation, and custom financial systems.",
      "url": "https://pmg-services.net",
      "logo": "https://pmg-services.net/assets/logo.png",
      "serviceType": ["Financial Consulting", "FP&A", "Financial Process Automation", "ERP Integration"],
      "areaServed": { "@type": "Place", "name": "Worldwide" },
      "contactPoint": {
        "@type": "ContactPoint",
        "contactType": "customer service",
        "email": "contact@pmg-services.net"
      }
    }
    </script>

    <!-- FAQPage structured data — enables featured snippets in Google -->
    <script type="application/ld+json">
    {
      "@context": "https://schema.org",
      "@type": "FAQPage",
      "mainEntity": [
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What is FP&A consulting?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "FP&A (Financial Planning & Analysis) consulting is the process of redesigning a company's financial planning, forecasting, and reporting function. A specialist FP&A consultant helps businesses replace static annual budgets with driver-based rolling forecasts, build real-time KPI dashboards, automate month-end close processes, and create the analytical infrastructure that enables faster, more confident financial decisions."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How do you use AI in finance processes?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We use AI where it earns its place: reading unstructured documents such as supplier invoices and contracts, coding transactions to the right accounts, flagging the exceptions worth a human review, and drafting variance commentary from the actual numbers. Models connect to your systems through MCP (Model Context Protocol) servers with explicit, logged permissions, so you control exactly what can be read. Nothing posts to your ledger without a person approving it."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Where does PMG Services operate?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "PMG Services works with companies internationally — engagements are delivered remotely and on-site, in both English and German."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What size companies do you work with?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Our engagements are best suited for mid-market companies — typically €30M to €500M (or equivalent) in annual revenue — that have outgrown spreadsheet-based finance but have not yet deployed a full enterprise FP&A platform. We also work alongside larger organizations on specific integration or automation workstreams."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How long does a financial transformation project take?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "It depends on scope. Our 90-Day FP&A Diagnostic Sprint is a fixed-scope, 13-week engagement that delivers a working forecast model and transformation roadmap. Full finance function transformations covering FP&A, process automation, and ERP integration typically run 6 to 18 months depending on technology stack complexity and organizational change required."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "What ERP systems do you integrate with?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We work across the major ERP platforms used by mid-market and enterprise companies, including SAP (ECC and S/4HANA), Oracle, NetSuite, and Microsoft Dynamics. Our integration work connects these systems to BI platforms such as Power BI and Snowflake to create a unified financial data layer."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "How is PMG Services different from a Big Four consulting firm?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "We are a focused specialist team rather than a generalist firm. That means faster mobilization, direct senior involvement throughout the engagement, and a narrower remit — we do not cross-sell strategy, HR transformation, or IT projects alongside the finance work. Our model is built for mid-market companies that want senior-level expertise without the overhead of a large consulting house."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          "name": "Do you offer fixed-price engagements?",
          "acceptedAnswer": {
            "@type": "Answer",
            "text": "Yes. Our 90-Day FP&A Diagnostic Sprint is a fixed-scope, fixed-deliverable engagement with a defined price agreed upfront. Larger transformation projects are scoped and priced on a project basis after a discovery phase. Contact us to discuss the right structure for your situation."
          }
        }
      ]
    }
    </script>
  </head>
