          </div>
          <h2 class="service-card-title">Financial Process Automation</h2>
          <p class="service-card-desc">In a lot of finance teams, invoice coding, reconciliation and month-end reporting are still done by hand. We connect the systems, automate the repetitive steps, and apply AI agents where a document has to be interpreted or an exception reviewed.</p>
          <ul class="service-features">
            <li>AI agents &amp; document processing</li>
            <li>MCP &amp; system integration</li>
            <li>Close &amp; reconciliation automation</li>
            <li>Reporting pipelines</li>
          </ul>
          <a href="./financial-process-automation.html" class="service-card-cta">Learn more →</a>
        </div>

        <!-- Card 3: Custom Financial Ecosystem -->
        <div class="service-card">
          <div class="service-visual-top">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 300 130" class="service-svg" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" role="img" aria-label="Orbital diagram with a PMG core connecting ERP, BI, data, API and automation systems into one integrated ecosystem">
              <defs>
                <pattern id="s3-dots" width="16" height="16" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="0.7" fill="#0b1d2c" opacity="0.05"/></pattern>
                <radialGradient id="s3-core" cx="38%" cy="32%" r="70%"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#1e4068"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#0b1d2c"/></radialGradient>
              </defs>
