          <h3 class="hww-title">Discover</h3>
          <p class="hww-desc">We start by looking at how your finance team works today: the data, the processes and the tools. Then we send you what we found, before suggesting anything.</p>
          <ul class="hww-bullets">
            <li>Process &amp; decision audit</li>
            <li>Data quality assessment</li>
            <li>Technology landscape review</li>
            <li>Stakeholder alignment sessions</li>
