          </div>
          <h3 class="hww-title">Deploy</h3>
          <p class="hww-desc">We build it together with your team and train them as we go, so the work keeps running after we leave.</p>
          <ul class="hww-bullets">
            <li>Agile delivery sprints</li>
            <li>Integration &amp; testing</li>
            <li>Team training &amp; adoption</li>
            <li>Hypercare &amp; handover</li>
