            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" class="linkedin-icon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 0h-14c-2.761 0-5 2.239-5 5v14c0 2.761 2.239 5 5 5h14c2.762 0 5-2.239 5-5v-14c0-2.761-2.238-5-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-11h3v11zm-1.5-12.268c-.966 0-1.75-.79-1.75-1.764s.784-1.764 1.75-1.764 1.75.79 1.75 1.764-.783 1.764-1.75 1.764zm13.5 12.268h-3v-5.604c0-3.368-4-3.113-4 0v5.604h-3v-11h3v1.765c1.396-2.586 7-2.777 7 2.476v6.759z"/></svg>
            LinkedIn
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- ─── FOUNDER (closing note) ─── -->
    <section id="founder" class="founder-section">
      <div class="founder-inner">
        <figure class="au-photo">
        <picture>
        <source type="image/webp"
        srcset="./assets/founder-piotr-ganski-620.webp 620w, ./assets/founder-piotr-ganski-1240.webp 1240w"
        sizes="(max-width: 860px) 88vw, 42vw">
        <img src="./assets/founder-piotr-ganski-620.jpg"
        srcset="./assets/founder-piotr-ganski-620.jpg 620w, ./assets/founder-piotr-ganski-1240.jpg 1240w"
        sizes="(max-width: 860px) 88vw, 42vw"
        width="1240" height="1456" decoding="async"
        alt="Piotr Ganski, founder and CEO of PMG Services, outside the New York Stock Exchange">
        </picture>
        </figure>
        <div class="founder-text">
          <div class="au-signature">
          <span class="au-sig-name">Piotr Ganski</span>
          <span class="au-sig-role" id="founder-role">Founder &amp; CEO</span>
          <span class="au-sig-bio" id="founder-bio">I founded PMG Services to close the gap between the data finance teams already have and the decisions they actually have to make. I previously worked in finance transformation at a Big Four firm, and I have led teams of 100+ people on S/4HANA transformation projects in multinational companies. We build the forecast models, reporting and automation that make that data usable, and we build them to keep running without us.</span>
          </div>
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-color-1 au-cta" id="founder-cta">Book a discovery call</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>


    </main>

    <!-- ─── CASE STUDY OVERLAY ─── -->
    <div id="case-study-overlay" class="cs-overlay" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="cs-dialog-title">
      <div class="cs-panel">
        <button class="cs-back" id="cs-back-btn">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
            <path d="M19 12H5"></path>
            <polyline points="12 19 5 12 12 5"></polyline>
          </svg>
          <span>Back to Projects</span>
        </button>
        <div class="cs-content" id="cs-content">
          <!-- Dynamically injected -->
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ─── FOOTER ─── -->
    <footer>
      <div class="footer-inner">
        <div class="footer-top">
          <div class="footer-brand">
            <img src="./assets/LOGO_PMG_white.png" alt="PMG Services" class="footer-logo" loading="lazy" />
            <p class="footer-tagline" id="footer-tagline">Financial Transformation &amp;<br>Digitalization Consulting</p>
          </div>
          <div class="footer-contact-col">
            <h3 class="footer-heading" id="footer-contact-heading">Contact</h3>
            <a href="mailto:contact@pmg-services.net" class="footer-link">contact@pmg-services.net</a>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/p-m-g-services/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="footer-link footer-linkedin">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M19 0h-14c-2.761 0-5 2.239-5 5v14c0 2.761 2.239 5 5 5h14c2.762 0 5-2.239 5-5v-14c0-2.761-2.238-5-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-11h3v11zm-1.5-12.268c-.966 0-1.75-.79-1.75-1.764s.784-1.764 1.75-1.764 1.75.79 1.75 1.764-.783 1.764-1.75 1.764zm13.5 12.268h-3v-5.604c0-3.368-4-3.113-4 0v5.604h-3v-11h3v1.765c1.396-2.586 7-2.777 7 2.476v6.759z"/></svg>
              LinkedIn
            </a>
          </div>
          <div class="footer-legal-col">
            <h3 class="footer-heading" id="footer-legal-heading">Legal</h3>
            <a href="./privacy-policy.html" class="footer-link" id="footer-privacy-link">Privacy Policy</a>
            <a href="./impressum.html" class="footer-link" id="footer-impressum-link">Impressum</a>
            <a href="#" class="footer-link" id="footer-cookie-link" onclick="event.preventDefault();if(window.pmgOpenConsent)pmgOpenConsent();">Cookie Settings</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="footer-bottom">
          <p id="footer-copyright">Copyright &#169; 2026 PMG Services. All Rights Reserved.</p>
